# Kokoro model weights (~340MB — over GitHub's 100MB file limit).
# ./setup --install downloads them; or fetch manually from
# github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx releases (model-files-v1.0).
runtime/models/kokoro/*.onnx
runtime/models/kokoro/*.bin

# per-machine / regenerable
runtime/remotion/node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
_qc/
venv/
.venv/

# medhavy-opt — private source material. The weekly reports name teammates and
# describe internal decisions; they are NOT published. SOURCES.md cites them.
hai_reports_weeks_*.md

# medhavy-opt — regenerable build artifacts. The final cut of each month IS
# committed; per-beat renders, narration mp3s and slate cuts are rebuilt by
#   venv/bin/python runtime/scripts/generate_audio_kokoro.py <reel>
#   venv/bin/python runtime/scripts/remotion_scenes.py <reel>
#   venv/bin/python runtime/scripts/compile.py <reel> --height 1080
medhavy-opt/youtube/*/media/
medhavy-opt/youtube/*/mp3/
medhavy-opt/youtube/*/clips/
medhavy-opt/youtube/*/*-slate.mp4
